# Keep the build context small and free of local state and secrets (SEC13).
.git
.github
**/node_modules
**/.next
**/out
**/dist
**/coverage
**/*.tsbuildinfo
**/next-env.d.ts
.env
.env.*
!.env.example
*.log
playwright-report
test-results
docs
infra/terraform
**/.terraform
**/*.tfstate
**/*.tfstate.*
**/*.tfvars
!**/*.tfvars.example
docker-compose*.yml
.DS_Store
